 153: 112593. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indcrop.2020.112593\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eGong XY, Meng Y, Lu J, Tao YH, Cheng Y, Wang HS (2022) A Review on Lignin-Based Phenolic Resin Adhesive. Macromol Chem Phys 223: 2100434. https://doi.org/10.1002/macp.202100434\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eGregorich N, Ding JH, Mark CT, Eric MD (2021) Novel composite hydrogels containing fractionated, purified lignins for aqueous-based separations. J Mater Chem A 9: 1025-1038. https://doi.org/10.1039/d0ta09046h\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eHe GB, Yan N (2004) \u003csup\u003e13\u003c/sup\u003eC NMR study on structure, composition and curing behavior of phenol-urea-formaldehyde resole resins. Polymer 45: 6813-6822. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.polymer.2004.08.019\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eHe GB, Yan N (2005) Influence of the Synthesis Conditions on the Curing Behavior of Phenol-Urea-Formaldehyde Resol Resins. J Appl Polym Sci 95: 1368-1375. https://doi.org/10.1002/app.21360\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eHuang CX, Peng ZW, Li JJ, Li XN, Jiang X, Dong YM (2022) Unlocking the role of lignin for preparing the lignin-based wood adhesive: A review. Ind Crop Prod 187: 115388. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indcrop.2022.115388\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eHuerta F, Quijada C, Montilla F, Morallon E (2021) Revisiting the Redox Transitions of Polyaniline. Semiquantitative Interpretation of Electrochemically Induced IR Bands. J Electroanal Chem 897: 115593. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jelechem.2021.115593\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eJackson WM, Conley RT (1964) High temperature oxidative degradation of phenol-formaldehyde polycondensates. J Appl Polym Sci 8: 2163-2193. https://doi.org/10.1002/app.1964.070080516\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003cli\u003eJin Y, Cheng X, Zheng Z (2010) Preparation and characterization of phenol-formaldehyde adhesives modified with enzymatic hydrolysis lignin. Bioresour Technol 101: 2046. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2009.09.085\u003c/l